{"name":"The Mismatch Sign","slug":"glyph-mismatch-sign","blurb":"On the veto street, Xio carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Mismatch. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Mismatch Sign.","seal":"9e8e509695329eb6af75fcbc2de1f229a483449c35b25021f08f2026c25046e3"}
